eadfba9c16f0fdf38a9f7570001d50f431fa","1cf97b54575377fec264400ad7584fbd54d29522"],"m":208},{"id":"alex_p9_209","t":"the last chart I learn a new thing but if euraud up to qm and down,then eurusd up,so audusd up to qm not down?I really don't know cross plate and straight plate","a":"glory305","d":"","n":"#209","p":9,"im":[],"m":209},{"id":"alex_p9_210","t":"`can u tell me gbpusd s/r and ftr which important?","a":"glory305","d":"","n":"#210","p":9,"im":[],"m":210},{"id":"alex_p9_211","t":"Glory, mate, you must have your strategic plan in trading. It's very important. Using your own plan, you will never think much - trade/no trade!","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#211","p":9,"im":["fb3353d744ea7b6945d47685675e66c120856274"],"m":211},{"id":"alex_p9_212","t":"I get complicated","a":"glory305","d":"","n":"#212","p":9,"im":[],"m":212},{"id":"alex_p9_213","t":"Buddy, no need to complicate. Our common way - only practice every day. Remember: forget about Money. I love look through many charts per day. We have to train every day. One day you see you will be like a pro! I know- Beauty is in the simplicity. Have a nice weekend Glory!","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#213","p":9,"im":[],"m":213},{"id":"alex_p9_214","t":"Hi. Step by step.\n\nUpdate","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#214","p":9,"im":["86fd683d7fb2775ec3caefd9e9ba6ba107a0c5c0","52d3e008ca8ff6dbb115c1d4163fcc2d63eb5c66"],"m":214},{"id":"alex_p9_215","t":"I love to modulate various situations, no difference when they took place, and to review them on FT.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#215","p":9,"im":["4a566eafdfb3d80d1995d9d2332c40f705b32248"],"m":215},{"id":"alex_p9_216","t":"I AM HAPPY TO U FOR ANSWER MY QUESTIONS.THIS IS MY PLAN.I LOVE UR QM AND DP","a":"glory305","d":"","n":"#216","p":9,"im":["e218f177451143378ae6a5488bab3bed581f3c4a"],"m":216},{"id":"alex_p9_217","t":"H i Glory, I see now for me main scenarios (1 and 2). Very interesting buddy. I will confirm this way HH\\HL or LH\\LL and check LTF (15-30 min).","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#217","p":9,"im":["9e6261d5bbb9f1aeb488f64f99ca652e5bc2a0bf"],"m":217},{"id":"alex_p9_218","t":"STEP by STEP.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#218","p":9,"im":["992fb6c5392db81d8286a3107ce49b9678d74aac","8ee6289fa3b02d5a87a6dba30744555bc3e276f8"],"m":218},{"id":"alex_p9_219","t":"my gbpjpy buy on the qm and sell SP500 DP\n\nI WAIT GOLD JUST U TELL ME THE QM","a":"glory305","d":"","n":"#219","p":9,"im":["6cbf286f2bfc77a00607e05fe2261f7e77608d52","b3ed366c8672db740bd48c5321005298d91c995f","3292f04c5bec72d8ce686d4c751ac0340051afac","a35d46440a7dcbdeb3387158263369d5bd1a6ce0"],"m":219},{"id":"alex_p9_220","t":"Since learned your method I learn a lot。THANKS ALEX CAN U GIVE ME SOME SUGGEST ON MY TRADE?","a":"glory305","d":"","n":"#220","p":9,"im":[],"m":220},{"id":"alex_p9_221","t":"Hi Glory, mate. I see that your charts improve constantly. You started searching trades on a case by case basis. It`s obvious that you work hard. In my opinion - no need to be in a hurry in this business. I like the phrase: \"Grass grows itself, without our efforts\". Our knowledge, experience will improve with each chart. It`s important to be disciplined and have patience.\n\nGood luck, buddy, you are on a right way!!!!","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#221","p":9,"im":[],"m":221},{"id":"alex_p9_222","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#222","p":9,"im":["e1f840cf20c5b69dc6852fbffc140c59816dc841","8893307b9e3b8ba1c353dd9c47a63b4ec5e095bd"],"m":222},{"id":"alex_p9_223","t":"am i right?","a":"glory305","d":"","n":"#223","p":9,"im":["bf332fac0ab32c936dbd6f65c98a5944c669fc91"],"m":223},{"id":"alex_p9_224","t":"am i right?","a":"glory305","d":"","n":"#224","p":9,"im":["bf332fac0ab32c936dbd6f65c98a5944c669fc91"],"m":224},{"id":"alex_p9_225","t":"Hi Glory, as to me - it`s still early to sell, buddy","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#225","p":9,"im":["e6866612e0dce765ff9d32f213cac82c030e2371"],"m":225}],"images":[{"k":"89e0a2664cc2351f4de3a1d3a5317d62fdc4bd78","t":"assets/thumbs/89e0a2664cc2351f4de